# Classic -- the original palette, untouched.
#
# There are deliberately no `map` lines here. A theme that lists none leaves
# the game's own colours exactly as they shipped, which makes this both the
# reference to compare the others against and the option for anyone who wants
# precisely what they had.

name    Classic
blurb   The original palette, exactly as it shipped.

# --- interface roles -------------------------------------------------------
# Chrome still needs colours even when the map keeps its own, so these are
# picked from the stock sixteen rather than invented.
ui      canvas      000000
ui      panel       0C0C0C
ui      border      808080
ui      title       FFFF00
ui      text        FFFFFF
ui      muted       A0A0A0
ui      accent      00FFFF
ui      selection   484848  DC
